## Leg A — pipeline on a committed resource-only fixture (pe-r53)

Command (fixture and lane paths abbreviated here for line length; both are
the committed corpus/fixtures/pe-r53/fixture.exe and this reports dir):

  analyzeHeadless.bat <tmp>/proj rev75cap \
    -import <lane>/corpus/fixtures/pe-r53/fixture.exe \
    -scriptPath <scratch> -postScript rev75_dump.py -deleteProject

Result: exit 0; script error under Ghidra 12.x (Jython removed — Python
scripts require PyGhidra): "Ghidra was not started with PyGhidra. Python is
not available". Retried with the same logic as a Java postScript
(rev75_dump.java): exit 0, output
  program_name=fixture.exe / image_base=140000000 / function_count=0 /
  // decompiled_ok=0 of 0
Ghidra's own output reports 0 functions for this artifact; the r53 fixture
is a resource-structure fixture. No decompile claim is made from this leg —
it exercises import+analysis+postScript only.

## Leg B — decompile leg on the authored fixture (corpus/fixtures/pe-r75-headless-smoke/)

Fixture: authored this round by the committed generator gen_pe_r75.py
(deterministic, no timestamps; byte-verifies its own premises before
writing). sha256 fixture.exe =
fe060de1bc5106f30dec532270fc634426484e4e2ef186e5b7617443950afd72, 1024
bytes. Regen check at landing: generator rerun to a second path, cmp against
the committed bytes → byte-identical (REGEN_BYTE_IDENTICAL). Declared
premises, re-derived from the built bytes by the generator's own asserts:
PE32+ magic 0x20b, machine 0x8664, entry RVA 0x1000 (file 0x200), image base
0x140000000, entry bytes B82A000000C3 = `mov eax, 0x2A; ret`.

Command:

  T=C:/Users/jpvei/AppData/Local/Temp/rev75-ghidra   (project dir; Ghidra
      refuses project paths with dot-prefixed path elements, so the project
      cannot live under the .zcode workspace — see lesson M-note)
  rm -rf $T/proj2 && mkdir -p $T/proj2
  REV75_OUT=<scratch>/codeable-decompiled.c \
  analyzeHeadless.bat $T/proj2 rev75cap2 \
    -import <lane>/corpus/fixtures/pe-r75-headless-smoke/fixture.exe \
    -scriptPath <scratch> -postScript rev75_dump.java -deleteProject \
    > ghidra-headless-codeable.log 2>&1
