Tool's own output (grep from the headless log):

  INFO  rev75_dump.java> REV75_DUMP wrote .../codeable-decompiled.c:
  1 functions, 1 decompiled (GhidraScript)

Decompiled output, verbatim (whole file; the expected `return 0x2a;` body
derived from the authored entry bytes is present):

  program_name=codeable.exe
  image_base=140000000
  function_count=1
  // ==== FUNC entry @ 140001000 ====

  undefined8 entry(void)

  {
    return 0x2a;
  }



