Match against the fixture's declared premises (truth.json): function name
`entry` at 140001000 = image base + entry RVA; body `return 0x2a;` = the
authored `mov eax,0x2A; ret`. Both agree with the bytes, independently of
the producer (Q03-style derivation from authored bytes + truth pin).

